MODULE: BackstopForgetsRebuild
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the backstop discards the batch after reading its terminals but never rebuilds
PERTURBS: Backstop

--- FIND
    /\ backstops' = backstops+1 /\ requested' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ backstops' = backstops+1 /\ requested' = FALSE
--- END
